---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Small Business Website Design & Digital Presence | Brighter Sites"
  description="Custom website design, technical SEO, local search setup, analytics, domains, and ongoing digital presence support for small businesses. Specialized experience with therapists, counselors, coaches, and wellness professionals."
>
  <section class="page-intro small-business-intro">
    <div class="container small-business-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Small business websites</p>
        <h1>A stronger website and digital presence for your small business.</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="small-business-lead">
        <p>
          Brighter Sites works with small businesses that want more than a page
          that simply exists online. We design and build the website, handle the
          technical launch, connect the search and analytics tools behind it, and
          can continue managing the web side of the business after launch.
        </p>
        <p>
          We work with small businesses broadly while specializing in websites
          for therapists, counselors, coaches, wellness professionals, and other
          service businesses where trust, clarity, and a strong professional
          presentation matter.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Website & digital presence services</p>
        <h2>The website is only one part of being easy to find and trust online.</h2>
        <p>
          A professional online presence combines the visible website with the
          technical, search, local, and measurement systems that support it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="small-business-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>Custom website design & development</h3>
          <p>
            A responsive website organized around your business, services,
            customers, and goals instead of forcing your information into a
            one-size-fits-all template.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Technical SEO foundations</h3>
          <p>
            Clear titles, headings, URLs, internal links, canonical signals,
            crawlable navigation, sitemap support, mobile usability, and the
            technical details that help search engines understand the site.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Local search & Google Business Profile</h3>
          <p>
            Help connecting the website to a consistent local business presence,
            including Google Business Profile setup or optimization when it fits
            the project.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Search Console & website analytics</h3>
          <p>
            Connect the tools that reveal search impressions, clicks, traffic
            sources, page activity, and other signals that can guide future
            website improvements.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Domain, DNS & Cloudflare setup</h3>
          <p>
            The technical work that connects your domain, website, and related
            services so the business has a stable foundation behind the public
            site.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Ongoing website management</h3>
          <p>
            Optional monitoring, maintenance, search review, analytics review,
            and website improvements after launch so the site does not become an
            abandoned one-time project.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container small-business-split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Digital marketing vs. digital presence</p>
        <h2>We focus on the website and organic digital foundation.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="small-business-copy">
        <p>
          “Digital marketing” can mean many different things, including paid ads,
          social media management, email campaigns, content production, and lead
          generation. Brighter Sites is not positioning itself as a full-service
          advertising agency.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our focus is the digital presence your marketing depends on: the
          website, search visibility, local business information, technical SEO,
          analytics, domains, performance, and ongoing website management.
        </p>
        <p>
          That makes Brighter Sites a good fit for owners who want the web and
          search side of the business handled carefully without paying for a
          broad marketing package they may not need.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section local-small-business-section">
    <div class="container local-small-business-panel">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Treasure Valley businesses</p>
        <h2>Local website design support is available across the Treasure Valley.</h2>
        <p>
          Brighter Sites serves businesses in Meridian, Boise, Eagle, Nampa,
          Kuna, Star, and the surrounding Treasure Valley, while also working
          remotely with businesses outside the area.
        </p>
      </div>
      <a class="button secondary" href="/treasure-valley-website-design/">
        Explore Treasure Valley website services
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="container small-business-split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Specialized experience</p>
        <h2>Small businesses broadly—with deeper experience in trust-based practices.</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="small-business-copy">
        <p>
          Brighter Sites began with a counseling practice, which created deeper
          experience with businesses where prospective clients are evaluating
          trust, fit, professionalism, privacy, services, and the person behind
          the business before making contact.
        </p>
        <div class="specialty-links">
          <a class="text-link" href="/therapist-websites/">Website design for therapists & counselors →</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/coaching-websites/">Website design for coaches →</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/wellness-practitioner-websites/">Website design for wellness professionals →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-panel">
        <p class="eyebrow">Free 15-minute consultation</p>
        <h2>Tell me what your business needs from the web.</h2>
        <p>
          We can talk through your current website, online presence, goals, and
          the parts you would rather not spend your own time learning and managing.
        </p>
        <a class="button" href="/contact/#consultation">Request a free consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .small-business-hero-grid,
  .small-business-split {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .small-business-intro h1 {
    max-width: 14ch;
  }

  .small-business-lead,
  .small-business-copy {
    max-width: 48rem;
  }

  .small-business-lead p + p,
  .small-business-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .small-business-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .small-business-grid article {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: white;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
  }

  .small-business-grid h3 {
    margin-bottom: .55rem;
  }

  .local-small-business-section {
    background: var(--ink);
  }

  .local-small-business-panel {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: center;
    color: #d6e4e1;
  }

  .local-small-business-panel h2 {
    max-width: 18ch;
    color: white;
  }

  .local-small-business-panel .eyebrow {
    color: #9fd1c8;
  }

  .local-small-business-panel p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 46rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .local-small-business-panel .button {
    width: fit-content;
    border-color: white;
    color: white;
  }

  .specialty-links {
    display: grid;
    gap: .65rem;
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .small-business-hero-grid,
    .small-business-split {
      grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .small-business-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .local-small-business-panel {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 70rem) {
    .small-business-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
